    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Geraghty offer to the market, this superbly located 4 bedroom bungalow with separate storage shed, standing on 0.49 acre with lovely views over the countrysideThis spacious bungalow is a short distance from the N2 - the Ashbourne-Slane Road and in close proximity to Rathfeigh Church, local schools at Cushenstown and Curraha, a choice of secondary schools and its location allows easy access to Dublin International Airport and all major road networks via the N2.Constructed in 1989, this much loved and cared for family home offers a balance of reception rooms and bedrooms to suit a growing family, has a tarmacadam driveway and parking area to the front and side for family and visiting friends.Its superb location and generous accommodation will attract the interest of those seeking a family home, in a rural setting, yet having all the conveniences of modern living only a short drive away. We expect strong interest from the outset and for transparency purposes, all bidding will be carried out on line via our unique bidding platform: \"MySherryFitz\" You can request a viewing via the platform also.Viewing is strictly by prior appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nComposite front door to the entrance hall\n\nSitting Room - \nMaple Flooring, fireplace with hardwood surround, picture rail\n\nDining Room - \nSliding patio door to rear garden\n\nKitchen / Breakfast Room / Dining Room - \nShaker style kitchen cupboards and base and eye level, plumbed for dishwasher and washing machine, exit door to garden\n\nHall to Bedroom Accommodation - \nAccess to attic space (not floored)\n\nBedroom 1 - \nPositioned at the front of the residence\n\nBathroom - \nHaving WC, WHB and Bath, Triton T90 Electric shower over bath?window for natural light and ventilation\n\nAiring Cupboard - \nShelving and dual immersion installed\n\nBedroom 2 - \nAnother double bedroom, positioned at the front of the residence\n\nBedroom 3 - \nThis double bedroom is also located at the front of the residence, heating controls\n\nBedroom 4 - \nA double bedroom positioned at the rear\n\nOutdoors - \nTimer entrance gates closing off the residence from the roadPost and Rail fencing to the front boundaryTarmacadam driveway and parking area to front and side Block built storage shed with uPVC door to the side and windowOutdoor tapBoiler House - wireless thermostat - replaced 6 years agouPVC facia and soffit\n\nIncluded in Sale - \nWindow dressings, electrical appliances\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Superbly located just off the N2 - Ashbourne/Slane Road</li><li>Close proximity to local Primary Schools at Cushenstown and Curraha</li><li>Short drive to Snail Box Public House</li><li>Excellent parking on tarmacadam driveway to front and side of residence</li><li>Double glazed windows - replaced 6 years ago</li><li>Boiler House - wireless thermostat - replaced 6 years ago</li><li>uPVC facia and soffit</li><li>Sky Broadband, Mains Water, Outdoor tap, Septic Tank - original system, OFCH - wireless thermostat - replaced 6 years ago</ul>"
      },
